# money-home

- Product spec: `docs/SPEC.md`. Read it before domain work.
- Stack: Vue 3 + Vite + TS + Pinia + Vue Router + PWA; FSD; Supabase (Auth, Postgres, RLS, Realtime).
- Currency: RUB. UI copy: Russian. Code/DB identifiers: English.
- Do not implement beyond the current task. No drive-by refactors.
- One household per user (v1). Family shares balance, income rules, purchases.
- Client env only: `VITE_SUPABASE_URL`, `VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`. Never ship `service_role`.
